Requirements: Python 3.8, uv (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and libpq headers
(`apt install libpq-dev` / `brew install libpq`) to build psycopg2.

Create the virtual environment and install all requirements (app + dev tools):

`$ make install`

Flask-OpenID needs setuptools<58 to build, which is why the install goes
through `build-constraints.txt`.

Enter the virtual environment:

`$ source venv/bin/activate`

To start the app run gunicorn (needs DATABASE_URL)
`$ gunicorn wsgi:app`

Linting (ruff, configured in pyproject.toml):

`$ make lint`    - run the linter
`$ make format`  - auto-format and apply safe fixes
`$ make check`   - lint + format check (no changes)
